        "TileImage": "$($repository 6f1e4a48-9efb-4b5e-b811-d596b9a0c5e6).Image",
        "Description": "Agent 47, I represent a clien who need services of the best Hitman, which would be you.\r\rWe have a contract for you. In Paris, at the Sanguine fashion show you need to liquidate 3 important attendees. These are U.S. Congressman Russell Walsh, Heir to the heavenly Throne Tren Po and the powerful Cameroonian insurgent warlod Mabaya Mzabuni.\r\rYou are to conceal your identity and visibly shoot your targets with a handgun. After that you disappear by boat. That is explicitly required by my client.",
